	(text "Wired with net labels: labels with the same name are one net. 18S Lean: no fuses, clamps or C-pin caps; generated from slave-18s by make_lean.py, do not edit by hand. C0 sense (CELL0, J1.1) and V- meet only at net tie NT1, which replaces F120.\nADBMS1818 Figure 112, isoSPI filtering per Fig. 104(B). See ../docs/slave-18s-design-basis.md."
